{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2019-12-17 09:30:00', 'title': 'Lilly Announces 2020 Financial Guidance, Updates 2019 Guidance', 'text': 'LILLY ANNOUNCES 2020 FINANCIAL GUIDANCE, UPDATES 2019 GUIDANCE.SEES FY 2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE $8.57 TO $8.67.SEES FY 2019 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $5.75 TO $5.85.SEES FY 2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE $6.38 TO $6.48.2020 REVENUE IS EXPECTED TO BE BETWEEN $23.6 BILLION AND $24.1 BILLION.OPERATING MARGIN IS EXPECTED TO BE 31 PERCENT ON A NON-GAAP BASIS IN 2020.EPS FOR 2020 EXPECTED TO BE $6.70 TO $6.80 ON A NON-GAAP BASIS.FY2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $5.81 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $6.63, REVENUE VIEW $23.52 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.ELI LILLY - DECREASE IN 2019 EXPECTED EPS ON REPORTED BASIS IS DUE TO NET CHARGE RELATED TO REPURCHASE OF DEBT & ADDITIONAL ASSET IMPAIRMENT, OTHERS.2019 REVENUE GUIDANCE OF $22.0 BILLION-$22.5 BILLION UNCHANGED.FY2019 REVENUE VIEW $22.15 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.ELI LILLY - 2020 REVENUE GROWTH EXPECTED TO BE DRIVEN BY VOLUME FROM KEY GROWTH PRODUCTS INCLUDING TRULICITY, TALTZ, BASAGLAR, JARDIANCE, AMONG OTHERS.ELI LILLY - 2020 REVENUE GROWTH EXPECTED TO BE DRIVEN BY VOLUME FROM KEY GROWTH PRODUCTS INCLUDING VERZENIO, CYRAMZA, OLUMIANT, EMGALITY, BAQSIMITM.2020 REVENUE GROWTH EXPECTED TO BE PARTIALLY OFFSET BY LOWER REVENUE FOR PRODUCTS THAT HAVE LOST PATENT EXCLUSIVITY.'}
